// Title: Wab Execution From Non Default Location
// Rule ID: 395907ee-96e5-4666-af2e-2ca91688e151
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.execution
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_wab_execution_from_non_default_location.yml
//
// Generated by sigma-to-kql converter
